          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/24/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "てきに　なめられないよう　がんばって にらみつけるが　こうかは　うすい。 くわえた　はっぱが　トレードマーク。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il fait son possible pour intimider ses adversaires avec un regard menaçant, mais sans succès. Il a l’habitude de constamment mâcher une feuille.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It does its best to be taken seriously by its enemies, but its glare is not sufficiently intimidating. Chewing on a leaf is its trademark.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "x",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/23/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "敵に　なめられないよう　がんばって にらみつけるが　効果は　薄い。 くわえた　葉っぱが　トレードマーク。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
